      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS TO THE REAL PROPERTY GAINS TAX ACT 1976 Commencement of amendments to the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Chapter comes into operation on 1 January 2022. Amendment of section 21b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_30",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "30",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in section 21b, by substituting for subsection (1a) the following subsection: “(1a) For the purposes of subsection (1), where the disposer in a disposal referred to in that subsection is— (a) a disposer under Part II of Schedule 5, the acquirer shall, in relation to disposal within a period of three years after the acquisition date of the chargeable asset, retain the whole of that money or a sum not exceeding five per cent of the total value of the consideration, whichever is the less, and whether or not that amount is so retained, the acquirer shall within a period of sixty days after the date of such disposal pay that amount to the Director General; or (b) a disposer under Part III of Schedule 5, the acquirer shall retain the whole of that money or a sum not exceeding seven per cent of the total value of the consideration, whichever is the less, and whether or not that amount is so retained, the acquirer shall within sixty days after the date of such disposal pay that amount to the Director General.”. Amendment of section 32"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_31",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "31",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_31__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_31__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 32(1) of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_31__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the word “tax” the words “, sums or debt”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_31__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “not exceeding five thousand ringgit” the words “not less than two hundred ringgit and not more than twenty thousand ringgit”. New section 57b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_32",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "32",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 57a the following section: “Tax identification number 57b. For the purposes of this Act, every person shall use the tax identification number assigned by the Director General under section 66a of the Income Tax Act 1967.”. Amendment of Schedule 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_33",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "33",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_33__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_33__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Schedule 2 to the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_33__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 3, by substituting for subsubparagraph 3(1)(b) the following subsubparagraph: “(b) (i) the transfer of assets between spouses; or (ii) the transfer of assets owned by an individual, by the wife of the individual or by an individual jointly with his wife or with a connected person, by a nominee for the individual, a nominee for the wife of the individual or a nominee for both, or by a trustee for the individual, a trustee for the wife of the individual or a trustee for both, to a company resident in Malaysia or not, controlled by the individual, by the wife of the individual, by the individual jointly with his wife or with a connected person, by the nominee for the individual, the nominee for the wife of the individual or the nominee for both, or by the trustee for the individual, the trustee for the wife of the individual or the trustee for both, for a consideration consisting of shares in the company or for a consideration consisting substantially of shares in the company and the balance of a money payment;”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_33__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subparagraph 33(d), by inserting after the word “paragraph” the words “34 or”. Amendment of Schedule 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_34",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "34",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Schedule 4 to the principal Act is amended in paragraph 2 by substituting for the formula to that paragraph the following formula: “(a) relating to the disposal of real property— AxC — B where A is part of the area of the chargeable asset disposed; B is the total area of the chargeable asset; C is ten thousand; or ten per cent of the chargeable gain, whichever is greater; (b) relating to the disposal of shares— AxC — B where A is the number of shares deemed to be a chargeable asset under paragraph 34 or 34a of Schedule 2 disposed; B is the total number of issued shares deemed to be a chargeable asset in relation to shares deemed to be chargeable asset under paragraph 34 or 34a of Schedule 2; C is ten thousand; or ten per cent of the chargeable gain, whichever is greater.”. Amendment of Schedule 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_35",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "35",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_35__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_35__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Schedule 5 to the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_35__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_35",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in Part I, in the column Rate of tax, by substituting for the words “5 per cent” the word “Nil” appearing in the fourth line; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_35__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_III__cl_35",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in Part II, by substituting for the words “society registered under the Societies Act 1966 [Act 335]” the words “body of persons registered under any written law in Malaysia”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "hasPart": [
