      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_26__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering the existing paragraph as subparagraph (1); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_26__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_26__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the renumbered subparagraph (1) the following subparagraph: “(2) Notwithstanding subparagraph (1), income tax shall be charged for a year of assessment on the chargeable income of a company other than a company to which paragraph 2a applies which has chargeable income exceeding one hundred million ringgit in the basis period for the year of assessment 2022 at the following rates: Chargeable RM Rate of income income tax For every ringgit 100,000,000 24 per cent of the first For every ringgit 100,000,000 33 per cent”; and exceeding"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_26__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after Part XVIII the following parts: “part XIX Notwithstanding Parts I, II and IV, income tax shall be charged for a year of assessment on the income of a unit holder other than an individual referred to in section 109da which is derived from Malaysia at the rate of 24 per cent of gross. PART XX Notwithstanding Parts I and IV, income tax shall be charged on the income of a person who is a resident which is received in Malaysia from outside Malaysia at the rate of 3 per cent of gross.”. Amendment of Schedule 6"
      }
    },
    {
