        "@value": "in paragraph 4b, by inserting after the words “paragraph 2” the words “or 2b”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_28__para_c",
