      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 9(e) in relation to subparagraphs 46(1)(s)(i) and (ii) of the Income Tax Act 1967 and paragraph 26(a) have effect for the year of assessment 2022."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_3__subsec_8",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 9(e) in relation to subparagraph 46(1)(s)(iii) of the Income Tax Act 1967 and paragraph 9(f) have effect for the years of assessment 2021 and 2022. Amendment of section 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Income Tax Act 1967, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in subsection 5(1a) by inserting after the words “109d,” the words “109da in respect of a non-resident unit holder other than an individual,”. Amendment of section 6"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 6(1) of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (n), by substituting for the full stop at the end of that paragraph a semicolon; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (n) the following paragraphs: “(o) subject to section 109da but notwithstanding any other provisions of this Act, income tax shall be charged for each year of assessment upon the income of a unit holder other than an individual which consists of interest distributed or credited by a unit trust that is a retail money market fund referred to in subsection 61(1a) at the appropriate rate as specified under Part XIX of Schedule 1; (p) income tax shall be charged upon the income of a person who is a resident which is received in Malaysia from outside Malaysia from 1 January 2022 until 30 June 2022 at the appropriate rate as specified under Part XX of Schedule 1.”. Amendment of section 6d"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 6d(3)(c) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “31 December 2021” the words “31 December 2022”. Amendment of section 39"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
