        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (c) of the proviso to paragraph (r), by substituting for the words “years of assessment 2020 and 2021” the words “years of assessment 2020 until 2023”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (s) the following paragraph: “(s) an amount limited to a maximum of one thousand ringgit expended or deemed expended under subsection (3) in that basis year by that individual as evidenced by receipts on the amount expended— (i) for the payment of accommodation at the premises registered with the Commissioner of Tourism under the Tourism Industry Act 1992 [Act 482]; (ii) for the payment of entrance fee to a tourist attraction; or (iii) for the purchase of domestic tour package through a licensed travel agent registered with the Commissioner of Tourism under the Tourism Industry Act 1992: Provided that— (a) for the purposes of subparagraphs (i) and (ii), the payment is made on or after 1 March 2020 but not later than 31 December 2022; and (b) for the purposes of subparagraph (iii), purchase is made on or after 1 January 2021 but not later than 31 December 2022;”;"
      }
