      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 77b the following section: “Tax identification number 77c. For the purposes of this Act, every person shall use the tax identification number assigned by the Director General under section 66a of the Income Tax Act 1967.”. Amendment of First Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_44",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "44",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The First Schedule to the principal Act is amended by substituting for item 31 and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars: “31 CONTRACT NOTE: Relating to the sale of any shares, stock or marketable securities in companies incorporated in Malaysia or elsewhere— (a) For every RM1,000 or fractional part of RM1,000 of the value of any shares or stock (b) For every RM1,000 or fractional part of RM1,000 of the value of any marketable securities"
      }
    },
    {
