      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53], the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 [Act 169], the Stamp Act 1949 [Act 378], the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 [Act 543], the Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990 [Act 445], the Promotion of Investments Act 1986 [Act 327], the Finance Act 2012 [Act 742] and the Finance Act 2018 [Act 812] are amended in the manner specified in Chapters II, III, IV, V, VI, VII, VIII and IX respectively."
